List the background tasks you started: their IDs, statuses, and goals.

This is your own subtree and nothing else — the tasks you dispatched, the
tasks those went on to dispatch, however many levels down. Tasks started
elsewhere are not listed, and neither is your own task if you are
yourself a delegation: you are not one of your own background tasks.

Use this to see what background work of yours is running before checking
on one (`task_result`) or stopping it (`task_cancel`). Takes no
parameters.
